// Package apierror owns this service's error taxonomy and the table that maps
// a category onto a transport's way of reporting it.
//
// Belongs here: the sentinel errors for the six categories — invalid,
// not_found, conflict, unauthorized, forbidden, internal — the helpers that
// wrap a cause into one, and the category-to-status table.
//
// Does NOT belong here: response bodies. The transport renders the RFC 9457
// problem+json document; this package tells it which category it is holding.
// A second transport adds a column to the table rather than a fork of it.
//
// Driver errors and stack traces never cross the transport boundary. Log the
// detail, return the category.
//
// Empty until Mint chunk 05.
package apierror
